abstract: >-
  BionApp (beta) is a desktop application for laboratory management of GMO
  (OGM) samples. This edition runs fully locally (Electron and SQLite):
  no cloud account is required. Data stay in a folder chosen by the user.
  The software is under testing and is not a certified clinical system.
